{
  "model": "gemini-3-5-flash",
  "openapi": {
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
      "title": "kie.ai",
      "description": "kie.ai API 文档",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "contact": {
        "name": "技术支持",
        "email": "support@kie.ai"
      }
    },
    "tags": [],
    "paths": {
      "/gemini/v1/models/gemini-3-5-flash:streamGenerateContent": {
        "post": {
          "summary": "Gemini 3.5 Flash",
          "deprecated": true,
          "description": ":::warning\n**⚠️ No longer available**\n\nGemini 3.5 Flash has been deprecated by Google and is no longer available on Kie.ai. Requests to this endpoint will fail. Please switch to [Gemini 3.6 Flash](https://docs.kie.ai/market/gemini/gemini-3-6-flash) or [Gemini 3.8 Flash](https://docs.kie.ai/market/gemini/gemini-3-8-flash) (same price).\n:::\n\n:::warning\n**⚠️ Chat only**\n\nThis model currently supports chat requests only and has not yet been adapted for agent use. Connecting it to an agent may cause request errors or unexpected results.\n:::\n\n### Streaming Support\n\nThe Gemini endpoint returns streaming chunks from `streamGenerateContent`. Function calling responses appear in `candidates[].content.parts[].functionCall`.\n\n**Streaming Response Format:**\n- Content-Type: text/event-stream. The last data chunk carries usageMetadata and credits_consumed, followed by data: [DONE].\n- Function calls are returned inside `parts[].functionCall`\n- Thinking output may be reflected through `thoughtSignature` and usage metadata\n\n## Features\n\n- Standard chat with `contents`.\n- Google Search grounding with `googleSearch`.\n- Function calling with `functionDeclarations`.\n- Thinking configuration with `generationConfig.thinkingConfig`.\n\n## Request Notes\n\n- Use `contents` as the primary conversation input.\n- Use `tools.googleSearch` to enable Google Search grounding.\n- Use `tools.functionDeclarations` to define callable functions.\n- Use `generationConfig.thinkingConfig` to control thoughts output and thinking level.\n\n## Authentication\n\nAuthentication: send your KIE API key as `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY`.\n\n## Error Responses\n\nErrors are returned with HTTP 200 and a JSON body {\"code\": <int>, \"msg\": \"<reason>\"}. Check code (200 = success) before reading choices/candidates.",
          "operationId": "gemini_3.5_flash",
          "tags": [],
          "parameters": [],
          "requestBody": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "stream": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "description": "If set to true, the response is returned as stream chunks.",
                      "default": true
                    },
                    "contents": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "Conversation input for Gemini.",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "role": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                              "user",
                              "model"
                            ],
                            "description": "Content role.",
                            "examples": [
                              "user"
                            ]
                          },
                          "parts": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "description": "Content parts. Use text, inline_data, or other supported part types.",
                            "items": {
                              "oneOf": [
                                {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {
                                    "text": {
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "description": "Plain text input.",
                                      "examples": [
                                        "What is the weather in Beijing today?"
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {
                                    "inline_data": {
                                      "type": "object",
                                      "description": "Inline binary payload.",
                                      "properties": {
                                        "mime_type": {
                                          "type": "string",
                                          "examples": [
                                            "image/jpeg"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                          "type": "string",
                                          "description": "Base64 content."
                                        }
                                      }
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {
                                    "file_data": {
                                      "type": "object",
                                      "properties": {
                                        "mime_type": {
                                          "type": "string",
                                          "description": "file mime type"
                                        },
                                        "file_uri": {
                                          "type": "string"
                                        }
                                      }
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "role",
                          "parts"
                        ]
                      },
                      "minItems": 1
                    },
                    "tools": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "Optional Gemini tools. Supports googleSearch and functionDeclarations.",
                      "items": {
                        "oneOf": [
                          {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "googleSearch": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "description": "Google Search grounding tool.",
                                "additionalProperties": false,
                                "properties": {}
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "functionDeclarations": {
                                "type": "array",
                                "description": "Function declaration list.",
                                "items": {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {
                                    "name": {
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "description": "Function name.",
                                      "examples": [
                                        "get_weather_forecast"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    "description": {
                                      "type": "string",
                                      "description": "Function description.",
                                      "examples": [
                                        "Get the weather forecast for a given location"
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    "parameters": {
                                      "type": "object",
                                      "description": "Function parameter schema.",
                                      "properties": {
                                        "type": {
                                          "type": "string",
                                          "examples": [
                                            "OBJECT"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "properties": {
                                          "type": "object",
                                          "additionalProperties": true,
                                          "properties": {}
                                        },
                                        "required": {
                                          "type": "array",
                                          "items": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                          }
                                        }
                                      },
                                      "examples": [
                                        {
                                          "type": "OBJECT",
                                          "properties": {
                                            "location": {
                                              "type": "STRING",
                                              "description": "The city name, e.g. Beijing"
                                            }
                                          },
                                          "required": [
                                            "location"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "required": [
                                    "name",
                                    "description",
                                    "parameters"
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "generationConfig": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "Generation configuration.",
                      "properties": {
                        "thinkingConfig": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "description": "Thinking configuration.",
                          "properties": {
                            "includeThoughts": {
                              "type": "boolean",
                              "description": "Whether to include thought output.",
                              "examples": [
                                true
                              ]
                            },
                            "thinkingLevel": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "enum": [
                                "low",
                                "high"
                              ],
                              "description": "Thinking level.",
                              "examples": [
                                "high"
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "contents"
                  ],
                  "examples": [
                    {
                      "stream": true,
                      "contents": [
                        {
                          "role": "user",
                          "parts": [
                            {
                              "text": "What is the weather in Beijing today?"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "tools": [
                        {
                          "functionDeclarations": [
                            {
                              "name": "get_weather_forecast",
                              "description": "Get the weather forecast for a given location",
                              "parameters": {
                                "type": "OBJECT",
                                "properties": {
                                  "location": {
                                    "type": "STRING",
                                    "description": "The city name, e.g. Beijing"
                                  }
                                },
                                "required": [
                                  "location"
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "generationConfig": {
                        "thinkingConfig": {
                          "includeThoughts": true,
                          "thinkingLevel": "high"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "stream": true,
                  "contents": [
                    {
                      "role": "user",
                      "parts": [
                        {
                          "text": "What is the weather in Beijing today?"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "tools": [
                    {
                      "functionDeclarations": [
                        {
                          "name": "get_weather_forecast",
                          "description": "Get the weather forecast for a given location",
                          "parameters": {
                            "type": "OBJECT",
                            "properties": {
                              "location": {
                                "type": "STRING",
                                "description": "The city name, e.g. Beijing"
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "location"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "generationConfig": {
                    "thinkingConfig": {
                      "includeThoughts": true,
                      "thinkingLevel": "high"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": true
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Request successful.",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "candidates": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "description": "Candidate results",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "content": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "role": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "examples": [
                                    "model"
                                  ]
                                },
                                "parts": {
                                  "type": "array",
                                  "items": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                      "functionCall": {
                                        "type": "object",
                                        "description": "Function call payload",
                                        "properties": {
                                          "args": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "description": "Function arguments",
                                            "additionalProperties": true,
                                            "properties": {}
                                          },
                                          "name": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "Function name",
                                            "examples": [
                                              "get_weather_forecast"
                                            ]
                                          },
                                          "id": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "Function call identifier",
                                            "examples": [
                                              "gp737npz"
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        }
                                      },
                                      "thoughtSignature": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Thought signature",
                                        "examples": [
                                          "Es8CCswCAb4example"
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      "text": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Text output"
                                      }
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            "finishReason": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Candidate finish reason",
                              "examples": [
                                "STOP"
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "modelVersion": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Returned model version. May be absent.",
                        "examples": [
                          "gemini-3-5-flash"
                        ]
                      },
                      "usageMetadata": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "description": "Token usage metadata",
                        "properties": {
                          "candidatesTokenCount": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "examples": [
                              18
                            ]
                          },
                          "thinkingTokenCount": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "examples": [
                              55
                            ]
                          },
                          "totalTokenCount": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "examples": [
                              325
                            ]
                          },
                          "promptTokenCount": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "examples": [
                              252
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "credits_consumed": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "description": "Credits consumed by the request",
                        "examples": [
                          0.01
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "example": {
                    "candidates": [
                      {
                        "content": {
                          "role": "model",
                          "parts": [
                            {
                              "functionCall": {
                                "args": {
                                  "location": "Beijing"
                                },
                                "name": "get_weather_forecast",
                                "id": "gp737npz"
                              },
                              "thoughtSignature": "Es8CCswCAb4example"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        "finishReason": "STOP"
                      }
                    ],
                    "modelVersion": "gemini-3-5-flash",
                    "usageMetadata": {
                      "candidatesTokenCount": 18,
                      "thinkingTokenCount": 55,
                      "totalTokenCount": 325,
                      "promptTokenCount": 252
                    },
                    "credits_consumed": 0.01
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            }
          },
          "security": [
            {
              "BearerAuth": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "webhooks": {},
    "components": {
      "schemas": {},
      "responses": {},
      "securitySchemes": {
        "BearerAuth": {
          "type": "http",
          "scheme": "bearer",
          "bearerFormat": "API Key",
          "description": "All API requests require a Bearer Token. Add the header `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY` to authenticate requests."
        }
      }
    },
    "servers": [
      {
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai",
        "description": "正式环境"
      }
    ],
    "security": [
      {
        "BearerAuth": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
